+           Chaque cas porte son code d'erreur JDWP comme `number` :

% 0 1 0 01eaeca5798d1a3b02d48ba44beec41c

@ 0 30 0 1a1107d77ff159ec0cc940c8d301478a
+           column  Cas
+           column  Code
+           column  Message
+           column  Remarque
+           row  `InvalidThread`  10  _the thread identifier was invalid_
+           row  `InvalidThreadGroup`  11  _the thread-group identifier was invalid_
+           row  `ThreadNotSuspended`  13  _the thread was not suspended_
+           row  `ThreadSuspended`  14  _the thread was already suspended_
+           row  `InvalidObject`  20  _the object identifier was invalid_
+           row  `InvalidClass`  21  _the class identifier was invalid_
+           row  `ClassNotPrepared`  22  _the class had not been prepared_
+           row  `InvalidMethod`  23  _the method identifier was invalid_
+           row  `InvalidLocation`  24  _the location was invalid_
+           row  `InvalidField`  25  _the field identifier was invalid_
+           row  `InvalidFrame`  30  _the frame identifier was invalid_
+           row  `NoMoreFrames`  31  _there were no more frames on the stack_
+           row  `OpaqueFrame`  32  _the frame was opaque (native)_
+           row  `TypeMismatch`  34  _the value did not match the expected type_
+           row  `InvalidSlot`  35  _the local-variable slot was invalid_
+           row  `NotFound`  41  _the requested item was not found_
+           row  `NotImplemented`  99  _the VM does not implement this command_
+           row  `NullPointer`  100  _a null pointer was encountered_
+           row  `AbsentInformation`  101  _the debug information was absent_
+           row  `InvalidEventType`  102  _the event type was invalid_
+           row  `IllegalArgument`  103  _an argument was illegal_
+           row  `VmDead`  112  _the virtual machine had died_
+           row  `Internal`  113  _the virtual machine reported an internal error_
+           row  `AlreadyInvoking`  502  _a method was already being invoked on the thread_
+           row  `Disconnected`  −1  _the connection to the debuggee was lost_  levée par cette bibliothèque, non par la VM : une connexion perdue, ou un lancement qui n'a jamais abouti
+           row  `Other(code)`  `code`  _the VM reported error code `code`_  tout numéro envoyé par la VM qui n'est pas nommé ici, pour que le décodage ne le perde jamais

